{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52557","headline":"其五 · 陈元光","name":"其五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戍楼西北望皇州，宿衙曾随上苑游。\n明月芦花迷曲岸，西风梧叶报清秋。\n凤凰台上几声笛，鹦鹉洲边一苇舟。\n对菊渊明怀刺史，抛梭织女弄牵牛。\n娟娟万里江河烂，耽耽孤星大火流。\n白雁远传苏武札，银鲈细切[季]（李）鹰[羞]（差）。\n露凄霜肃吴砧捣，马壮兵强楚戍愁。\n报道四更笳鼓响，衔枚袭虏献俘囚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}